                <pb facs="0481" n="455" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v04/pg455"/>

                <head>Tab A<anchor n="6" xml:id="d177-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>I should like to make it clear that consistent with the delegated authority
                    contained in Section 3(a)(1) of Executive Order 11269 dated February 14, 1966,
                    the Secretary of the Treasury, in accordance with Presidential determinations
                    reached upon the advice of the Council on International Economic Policy, should
                    give instructions to the representatives of the United States to the respective
                    organizations pursuant to Section 21 of the Inter-American Development Bank Act,
                    Section 18 of the Asian Development Act, and Section 12 of the International
                    Development Association Act.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
